      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not explicitly define the primary somatosensory area as being involved in “handling touch-related information.” It only states that beta-band activity at electrodes “around the primary somatosensory area” was measured during tactile-stimulus trials.",
        "Although the packet supports that activity around the primary somatosensory area changed before tactile onset and that this was interpreted in relation to prediction (ERSP used as an index of prediction), the first sentence contains an unsupported general functional characterization."
